+                    "5,000,000 characters of text per query (the text cap)"
+                    "identity, ground, untuple, get, get-else, get-some, not-empty, max and min pass values through"
+                    "counts toward 20,000 function calls per query (the call cap)"
+                    "charges the rows it joins, subtracts or sums toward 200,000 rows of relation work per query (the work cap)"
